Hi Mike,

On 4 Oct 2012, at 21:50 , Michael Muratet wrote:

> Is there a main_cex parameter? Can I make the title smaller?

No, unfortunately not. 

> Do margins work differently in grid plots? Applying par(oma=c(10,10,10,10)) before the first viewport call does not seem to have an effect.

No, the par function works only with the base plots. You would need to play with viewports to add a margin.

For both your questions, a quick edit of the resulting pdf in inkscape would probably save you a lot of tweaking, unless you plan to do a lot of similar plots...

Best,

